    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#being-rendered\r\n> An element is being rendered if it has any associated CSS layout boxes, SVG layout boxes, or some equivalent in other styling languages.\r\n\r\nc-v:hidden subtree elements technically have CSS layout boxes that have been cached, but they are in a \"stale\" state which may be incomplete and can lead to crashes when they are used. Maybe we could update this definition for content-visibility? @vmpstr ",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
