    "created_at": "2023-12-19T19:23:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-12-19T19:23:54Z",
    "body": "@vmpstr what if we made the following change to the html spec?\r\n\r\nbefore: \r\n> An element is being rendered if it has any associated CSS layout boxes, SVG layout boxes, or some equivalent in other styling languages.\r\n\r\nafter:\r\n> An element is being rendered if it has any associated CSS layout boxes, SVG layout boxes, or some equivalent in other styling languages, **and is not the flat tree descendant of an element which is [skipping its contents](https://www.w3.org/TR/css-contain-2/#skips-its-contents).**",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
