    "updated_at": "2023-12-19T20:17:39Z",
    "body": "Yeah I think that we want this definition to handle c-v:hidden and offscreen c-v:auto the same way. How can we word this?\r\n\r\nI think that it is rare for any part of the spec to care about the difference between c-v:hidden and offscreen c-v:auto, but in the case of find-in-page, it handles it on its own without relying on the \"being rendered\" definition: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#interaction-with-details-and-hidden=until-found",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
